Vendo CLI — manage your data pipeline from the terminal

Usage: vendo [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  login         Authenticate with your Vendo account
  init          Guide first-time Vendo CLI setup
  logout        Remove stored credentials
  config        Manage CLI configuration
  profile       Manage account profiles
  status        Account health overview
  whoami        Show the current authenticated account
  apps          Manage app connections
  sources       Manage data sources
  integrations  Manage data export integrations [alias: int]
  jobs          Monitor sync jobs
  catalog       Browse available integration types
  dictionary    Browse the data dictionary catalog
  metrics       Manage custom metrics in the Metrics Library
  models        Manage data models
  measurement   Inspect Marketing Measurement methodologies, LTV, and signals
  mcp           Show how to connect an MCP client (Claude, Cursor, Windsurf) to Vendo
  completions   Generate shell completion script (bash, zsh, fish)
  doctor        Run local configuration and connectivity checks
  self-update   Update the Vendo CLI using the hosted installer
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -V, --version         Print version
  -h, --help            Print help
